OL,3,AEx-Zambian minister killed in security
OL,4,Araid on opposition
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Zambian minister was killed in
OL,7,Flast week's raid by security forces on
OL,8,Fa house linked to opposition leader
OL,9,FBrian Mundubile a day after the
OL,10,Fpresidential election, the authorities
OL,11,Fhave said.
OL,13,FA police spokesman said Mutotwe Kafwaya
OL,14,Fwas fatally wounded by law enforcement
OL,15,Fofficers during what officials have
OL,16,Fdescribed as an exchange of fire in a
OL,17,Fsecurity operation in the capital,
OL,18,FLusaka, on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
