OL,3,AEx-Zambian minister killed in security
OL,4,Araid on opposition
OL,5,
OL,6,FEleven people were arrested in the
OL,7,Fraid, with the authorities accusing
OL,8,FMundubile's party, the NRPUP, of being
OL,9,F"involved in insurgency" and "militia
OL,10,Factivity" and storing "high-grade"
OL,11,Fweapons.
OL,13,FMundubile, who has since gone into
OL,14,Fhiding, rejected the allegations as
OL,15,F"total fabrications".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
